     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ServiceRequest example-drp-nursing-med-preparation-appendix-81</b></p><a name=\"example-drp-nursing-med-preparation-appendix-81\"> </a><a name=\"hcexample-drp-nursing-med-preparation-appendix-81\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ereferral-annex-81.html\">EReferralAnnex81</a></p></div><p><b>BeValidityPeriod</b>: 2026-02-18 --&gt; 2027-02-18</p><p><b>status</b>: Draft</p><p><b>intent</b>: Proposal</p><p><b>category</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://snomed.info/sct 9632001}\">Nursing procedure</span>, <span title=\"Codes:{https://www.ehealth.fgov.be/standards/fhir/terminology/CodeSystem/be-cs-prescription-type medication-prefill-preparation-appendix-81}\">Preparing medication (Appendix 81)</span></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://snomed.info/sct 385796006}\">urn:be:fgov:pseudo-encrypted:v1:{{kid}}:{{jwe}}</span></p><p><b>subject</b>: Identifier: <a href=\"https://www.ehealth.fgov.be/standards/fhir/core/2.1.2/NamingSystem-be-ssin.html\" title=\"NISS/INSZ\">BeSSINNamingSystem</a>/urn:be:fgov:pseudo:v2:{{SEC1}}:{{transit-info}} (use: official)</p><p><b>authoredOn</b>: 2026-02-18 15:03:57+0100</p><p><b>requester</b>: <a href=\"PractitionerRole-67120919457-NURSE.html\">Nurse Example (official) (https://www.ehealth.fgov.be/standards/fhir/core/NamingSystem/ssin#BeSSINNamingSystem#67120919457 (use: official)): nurse</a></p><p><b>reasonCode</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://snomed.info/sct 275928001}\">Drugs - partial non-compliance</span>, <span title=\"Codes:{http://snomed.info/sct 1290542000}\">Unintentional misuse of medication</span>, <span title=\"Codes:{http://snomed.info/sct 129834002}\">Noncompliance with medica